et_id":"huntik:page:8536","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Titan_of_the_Forest","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8536"}]},{"name":"last appearance","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]},{"name":"see also","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]}],"start":0,"end":474}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"According to the British legend, the Titan Arawn was of the famous Robin Hood, who came with his Titans until he was famous in the whole of England. Contrary to popular opinion  Robin Hood did not come from Nottingham and Sherwood Forest, but from an area in Yorkshire, known as Loxley and this is reflected in the actual birth name of Robin Hood: Robin of Locksley.{{source|The Titan of the Forest}}","text":"According to the British legend, the Titan Arawn was of the famous Robin Hood, who came with his Titans until he was famous in the whole of England. Contrary to popular opinion  Robin Hood did not come from Nottingham and Sherwood Forest, but from an area in Yorkshire, known as Loxley and this is reflected in the actual birth name of Robin Hood: Robin of Locksley.[The Titan of the Forest]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Arawn is an archer of the highest level, able to fire arrows with perfect accuracy.\n{{Clear}}","text":"Arawn is an archer of the highest level, able to fire arrows with perfect accuracy."},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nArawn the Hunter amulet.jpg|Arawn the Hunter's Amulet\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Draco-Titans]]\n[[Category:Warrior Titans]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Titans]]\n[[Category:Average Titans]]\n[[Category:Comic Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{DracoBox}}","text":"Image caption: Arawn the Hunter's Amulet"}],"full_text":"Arawn the Hunter is a Draco-Titan archer that belonged to the legendary Robin Hood. Arawn was left to reside in Barnsdale Forest in Yorkshire, England until his Amulet was recovered by Lok Lambert.\n\nHistory\n\nAccording to the British legend, the Titan Arawn was of the famous Robin Hood, who came with his Titans until he was famous in the whole of England. Contrary to popular opinion  Robin Hood did not come from Nottingham and Sherwood Forest, but from an area in Yorkshire, known as Loxley and this is reflected in the actual birth name of Robin Hood: Robin of Locksley.[The Titan of the Forest]\n\nAbilities\n\nArawn is an archer of the highest level, able to fire arrows with perfect accuracy.\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Arawn the Hunter's Amulet","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox Titan\n| image           = File:Arawn_the_Hunter.png\n| attack          = 3\n| defense         = 2\n| attack pb       =\n| defense pb      =\n| type            = [[Draco-Titan]] Warrior\n| size            = Average\n| ability         = Target Shot\n| ability pb      =\n| users           = [[Robin Hood]] <br> [[Lok Lambert]]\n| height          = 2.13 m\n| weight          = 103 kg\n| first appearance = \"[[The Titan of the Forest]]\"\n| last appearance =\n| see also        = \n}}'''Arawn the Hunter''' is a [[Draco-Titan]] archer that belonged to the legendary Robin Hood. Arawn was left to reside in Barnsdale Forest in Yorkshire, [[England]] until his [[Amulet]] was recovered by [[Lok Lambert]].\n\n==History==\nAccording to the British legend, the Titan Arawn was of the famous Robin Hood, who came with his Titans until he was famous in the whole of England. Contrary to popular opinion  Robin Hood did not come from Nottingham and Sherwood Forest, but from an area in Yorkshire, known as Loxley and this is reflected in the actual birth name of Robin Hood: Robin of Locksley.{{source|The Titan of the Forest}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nArawn is an archer of the highest level, able to fire arrows with perfect accuracy.\n{{Clear}}\n==Gallery==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nArawn the Hunter amulet.jpg|Arawn the Hunter's Amulet\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:Draco-Titans]]\n[[Category:Warrior Titans]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Titans]]\n[[Category:Average Titans]]\n[[Category:Comic Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{DracoBox}}","categories":["Average Titans","Comic Titans","Draco-Titans","Huntik Foundation Titans","Titans","Warrior Titans"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:2831","status":"resolved","target_title":"Draco-Titan","label":"Draco-Titan","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Draco-Titan","href":"#/categories?name=Draco-Titans"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8790","status":"resolved","target_title":"Robin Hood","label":"Robin Hood","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Robin_Hood","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8790"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1983","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8536","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Titan of the Forest","label":"The Titan of the Forest","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Titan_of_the_Forest","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A8536"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2831","status":"resolved","target_title":"Draco-Titan","label":"Draco-Titan","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Draco-Titan","href":"#/categories?name=Draco-Titans"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:10365","status":"resolved","target_title":"England","label":"England","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/England","href":"#/categories?name=England"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1993","status":"resolved","target_title":"Amulet","label":"Amulet","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Amulet","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1993"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1983","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Category:Titans","label":"Category